    skos:editorialNote "This concept is a controlled value naming the auditory neural system as a stimulation target. ADR 0021 holds such a value to be an information category rather than the entity it classifies, while UBERON:0016490 auditory system denotes the entity itself, so closeMatch is the strongest defensible relation and exactMatch is deliberately not asserted."@en .

